asset:        background.svg
title:        CinemaGrid macOS DMG window background
author:       @XusBadia (original CinemaGrid design), modified for CinemaGrid by bsarika
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file: LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE
added:        2026-10-08 by @XusBadia
notes:        Original work for this repository, derived from the app icon (assets/app-icon/filmcraft.svg, referenced via <image>, not copied). Text is outlined Inter / JetBrains Mono glyph paths. Rebranded to CinemaGrid on 2026-10-14 by bsarika: the title glyphs were re-outlined as "CinemaGrid" (Inter SemiBold, same size and position as the former title) and the linked icon is now the CinemaGrid app icon. Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
